<title>USA: TABLE-Minnesota Mining Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Minnesota Mining Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.01		    $0.91</p>
<p> Net			418,000		  381,000</p>
<p> Revs		   3,817,000		3,522,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 415,500		  418,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.99		    $1.78</p>
<p> Net			828,000		  743,000</p>
<p> Revs		   7,531,000		6,990,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 416,100		  418,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Currency effects reduced 1997 Q2 earnings by an estimated $0.05/shr, or nearly 6 pct.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
